3rAZ.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>6. Damn, she strong</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/KlCyHzc.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>7. Nature is amazing! The Amazon river meets the Rio Negro, but doesn’t mix due to different densities and compositions.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/sNeEsJx.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>8. nom nom nom</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/SPUzaM2.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>9. Hey you, you reading this. You're cute heh</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/jAg5fEV.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>10. Her faces are adorable</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/pPiBvrM.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>11</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/ApvnajL.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>12. Dog enjoying a night out with a balloon</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/CN2I58B.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>13. The life of a wildlife photographer</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/JsAulUb.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/RmFbJcu.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>15. And I wanted to share something personal. A streamer friend of mine is doing a charity stream and one of the challenges was judging viewer food. This is the meal I submitted because I wanted to help with interesting content as well as donating a small sum: Quattro Formaggi Pasta.
Basically pasta with 4 cheeses. It's an Italian recipe and it's pretty great.

